Kind: ablation
Issue: #940
Over: 940-widen-dead-space.patch
Takes out: 11089259 -- the resolve with nothing locked asks whether the space is alive only at its end again, in urmach_msg_rights_hold(), so over 940-widen-dead-space act_test [57]'s question, let go after its space has died, reads the dead space's table, which still names the port ipc_right_clean() let go, and locks a port whose memory is back in its zone; 940-probe-given-back stops the kernel when the zone hands the port out
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4
Expect: 940-probe-given-back: a port's lock was taken after its memory went back to its zone
diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/ipc/mach_msg.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/ipc/mach_msg.c
index b7670608..cfa26041 100644
--- a/uros/src/mach_kernel/ipc/mach_msg.c
